summary='''# r341 standalone research handoff

Reservation: exactly 20 fixed IDs; SHA256 4309f659f8cd448e92e3e5427531437d39f7759e52dff0053a18ddbb49adc639 verified before extraction and after research. No reselection. Accepted credit 0; campaign stays 52/60 beyond 39 prior. This is a completed bounded research report with unresolved mathematical/literature gates, not a claim that every requested qualification gate was cleared.

The strongest sustained routes were toroidal K3,3 rigidity, tree reconfiguration necessity, and tensor-resultant multiplicity. ORDINARY-ATTEMPTS.md contains explicit mechanisms, the failed shortcuts, what survives and precise missing lemmas. The local stress helper and star sufficiency are zero-credit partial/source deductions. No source-qualified new ordinary candidate survived, so no CANDIDATE.md or dormant execution packet was created and no Pi work was dispatched.

Public source bridges block Numerical Terao (363865), Lew (363952), and LR self-duality (358311). Tensor multiplicity (365524) has an exact public full-scope claim in Zheng 2601.04514; selected proof bodies were read but a Macaulay matrix rank bridge was not independently validated. This is a HOLD/public-claim finding, not a certified external proof. Translation loopholes (357256,357736) and unrestricted symplectic rescaling (366387) are complete wording/domain corrections and earn zero. 358287 has conflicting corpus status text; no refutation was inferred from it.

All 20 raw corpus lines retain their final newline and full parsed records. literal-provenance.json binds original absolute chunk, one-based line, complete-chunk hash, raw-line hash and literal UTF-8 statement hash. results.json is exactly ID-keyed, includes all literal statements, separate scope/source/prior/subsumption/novelty/significance gates, and actual depth rather than acquisition counts.

Historical scope: only the supplied exact completed allowlist, protected paths filtered before opening. 297 result files were inspected. Two ID substring hits were inside hashes; semantic ID reconciliation found zero actual target entries. Family/title/source-URL checks are logged separately. r340 is included. No recursive campaign-body search, active formal-lane reads, crown-body reads/hashes/globs, git, dependencies, shared writes, parent notes, Lean, solver, CAS, mathematical search execution, accounts, contacts, uploads, browser or publishing actions occurred.

Current public registry pages were GET-fetched. LeanPool head 882795354c57bfed5c5fbbf950aa8ff840f4ff17 and OpenAI/math head 4eaee87548250b2682affda7d05d947c05554bae were observed in public page metadata. Pinned candidate README/import routing snapshots are preserved. projects.yml returned 404; the replacement individual YAML-card set was not fully inspected. There is no registry-absence novelty clearance or reconstructed first-public-merge chronology. Earlier immutable registry snapshots were not fully reconciled. No OpenAI theorem deduction depended on an unread manuscript.

Source limits: 20 abstracts and 19 latest HTML bodies acquired; one primary HTML 404. These are not 19 complete body reviews. Promising sources have explicit selected definition/proof review; Fan v1/v2 were acquired and parsed but not fully reviewed. Lorand and Beaton each list only v1 in current arXiv history; Fan lists v1/v2/v3. No journal/correction located for Lorand/Beaton in the bounded search, which does not prove none exists. Relevant companion/citing bodies are partly reviewed, as recorded. No figure raster was inspected; exact table entries and captions were read. Material unread sources remain HOLD.

Resource/access limits: each substantive Python script installs at most two available CPUs, CPU<=120s and AS<=6GiB before data reads; external command timeouts <=140s, Python -I -B, fetch threads<=2, no background handback. Fetches have unique URL/UTC/status-or-error/bytes/hash receipts; no newly denied route retried. Known inherited-denied hosts were not directly requested. Thread pools joined and all tool-returned processes exited. Resource files contain self rusage, not concurrent cgroup/group peaks. Early small inspection/helper invocations did not persist unique full resource telemetry; their true exits are available in tool outputs. Do not represent this as complete per-invocation resource accounting. No sampled RSS or retrospective fabricated peaks are claimed. bootstrap-receipt.json is preserved unchanged.

Artifacts: results.json; SUMMARY.md and BRIEF.md; ORDINARY-ATTEMPTS.md; literal/ and literal-provenance.json; review-depth-inventory.json; read-inventory-initial.json, history-read-inventory.json and read-inventory-final.json; http-receipts.json and the distinct invocation receipts; registry-review.json; search-inventory.json; reservation-before.json and reservation-after.json; artifact-manifest.json and manifest-verification.json. Full Lean semantics, only the permitted three axioms, independent review, paper and safe extracted strict replay remain future root gates for any eventual candidate. No paper was written.

'''
